# 22. Git 提交规范

每个阶段单独提交：

```powershell
git status
git diff --stat
git diff

npm test
npm run verify:summary

git add .
git commit -m "feat(game001): implement V5 night protocol phase A"
```

推荐提交：

```text
feat(game001): add protocol and evidence engines
feat(game001): add investigation tools and contamination
feat(game001): add event chains and high-risk resolution
feat(ui): rebuild Canvas layout for V5 night protocol
feat(game001): add causal debrief timeline
test(game001): cover V5 protocol and evidence rules
docs(game001): update V5 handoff and acceptance criteria
```

---

